      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Writing the note",
      "prov:value": "A file under `test/results/` is\na working copy: its record is the entry the CI job `qa-publish` stores on the\norphan `qa-reports` branch, keyed `main/<sha>/` or `pr/<n>/<sha>/` (arc\n`3fva`), and the committed copy goes when bean `5hox` removes it. So cite it\nas `qa-reports:main/<sha>/<path>` — the same locator `bun run cat qa:fetch --ref`\nreads — or the citation dangles the day the file leaves `main`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 5hox",
        "arc 3fva"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
